{"type":"message","id":"974b14c0","parentId":"3548f5aa","timestamp":"2026-04-30T18:44:29.213Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"read_1777574669202_35","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/openclaw-tavily-search/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google-native","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":848,"output":33,"cacheRead":25163,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26044,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777574668270,"responseId":"DKPzafaLHemCqtsPkKbQ8QQ"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f69cda37","parentId":"974b14c0","timestamp":"2026-04-30T18:44:29.218Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read_1777574669202_35","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: tavily-search\ndescription: \"Web search via Tavily API (alternative to Brave). Use when the user asks to search the web / look up sources / find links and Brave web_search is unavailable or undesired. Returns a small set of relevant results (title, url, snippet) and can optionally include short answer summaries.\"\n---\n\n# Tavily Search\n\nUse the bundled script to search the web with Tavily.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Provide API key via either:\n  - environment variable: `TAVILY_API_KEY`, or\n  - `~/.openclaw/.env` line: `TAVILY_API_KEY=...`\n\n## Commands\n\nRun from the OpenClaw workspace:\n\n```bash\n# raw JSON (default)\npython3 {baseDir}/scripts/tavily_search.py --query \"...\" --max-results 5\n\n# include short answer (if available)\npython3 {baseDir}/scripts/tavily_search.py --query \"...\" --max-results 5 --include-answer\n\n# stable schema (closer to web_search): {query, results:[{title,url,snippet}], answer?}\npython3 {baseDir}/scripts/tavily_search.py --query \"...\" --max-results 5 --format brave\n\n# human-readable Markdown list\npython3 {baseDir}/scripts/tavily_search.py --query \"...\" --max-results 5 --format md\n```\n\n## Output\n\n### raw (default)\n- JSON: `query`, optional `answer`, `results: [{title,url,content}]`\n\n### brave\n- JSON: `query`, optional `answer`, `results: [{title,url,snippet}]`\n\n### md\n- A compact Markdown list with title/url/snippet.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Keep `max-results` small by default (3–5) to reduce token/reading load.\n- Prefer returning URLs + snippets; fetch full pages only when needed.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777574669217}}
{"type":"message","id":"1c4aefb0","parentId":"f69cda37","timestamp":"2026-04-30T18:44:31.265Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"⚙️ Fase 1: Buscando información de Senerc...♟️","textSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_1777574671238_36","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/openclaw-tavily-search/scripts/tavily_search.py --query \"Senerc https://senerc.com.co/\" --max-results 1 --format brave"}}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google-native","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":1388,"output":172,"cacheRead":25160,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26720,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777574669220,"responseId":"DaPzacaYGueBqtsP3ffrmQQ"}}
{"type":"message","id":"7e492a8b","parentId":"1c4aefb0","timestamp":"2026-04-30T18:44:31.380Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_1777574671238_36","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Missing TAVILY_API_KEY. Set env var TAVILY_API_KEY or add it to ~/.openclaw/.env\n\n(Command exited with code 1)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":1,"durationMs":103,"aggregated":"Missing TAVILY_API_KEY. Set env var TAVILY_API_KEY or add it to ~/.openclaw/.env\n\n(Command exited with code 1)","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1777574671379}}
{"type":"message","id":"9972fc3f","parentId":"7e492a8b","timestamp":"2026-04-30T18:44:33.360Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"⚠️ Tavily Search falló. Necesito tu clave API para continuar.♟️","textSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read_1777574673336_37","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/web-tools-guide/references/web-search-config.md"}}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google-native","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":26772,"output":169,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26941,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777574671381,"responseId":"D6PzafOCJNfkqtsP4pi64AM"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b03253e0","parentId":"9972fc3f","timestamp":"2026-04-30T18:44:33.366Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read_1777574673336_37","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Web Search API 配置流程\n\n当 `web_search` 返回错误后，Agent 读取此文件并按步骤执行。\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: 初始引导（检测到未配置状态）\n\n**⚠️ 关键约束**：停止 fallback 链。将下方引用块（`>` 开头的部分）**原样输出**给用户。不要重新组织、改写表格结构、或编造额外信息（如\"无需绑定信用卡\"）。直接复制粘贴：\n\n> 搜索功能需要配置 API Key 才能使用。\n>\n> **推荐方案**（二选一）：\n> - **Tavily**: https://app.tavily.com — 国际内容效果好，每月 1000 免费积分\n> - **Kimi**: https://platform.moonshot.cn — 中文内容效果佳\n>\n> **计费对比**：\n>\n> | 对比维度 | Tavily | Kimi |\n> |---------|--------|------|\n> | **免费额度** | 每月 1000 次基础搜索免费 | 无免费额度，每次≈0.03元 |\n> | **计费模式** | 失败不收费 | 固定0.03元/次+Token费 |\n>\n> 请提供您的 API Key（格式：`tvly-xxx...` 或 `sk-xxx...`），或回复\"暂不配置\"使用备选方案。\n\n**如果用户选择\"暂不配置\"：**\n1. 回到 SKILL.md 的降级决策流程（使用 web_fetch 配合搜索引擎 URL，或 browser）\n2. 告知用户：\"已切换到备选方案。如需更好体验，可随时配置 API Key。\"\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: 接收 API Key 并分析\n\n**⚠️ 收到用户的 Key 后，必须先执行本步骤。禁止跳过分析和确认直接进入 Step 3 配置。**\n\n**当用户提供 API Key 时：**\n\n1. **通过前缀自动检测提供商**：\n   - `tvly-*` → Tavily\n   - `sk-*` → Kimi\n   - 未知前缀 → 询问用户使用哪个提供商\n\n2. **分析并告知用户**（先不配置）：\n   - 如果 `tvly-*`：\"检测到您提供的是 **Tavily** 的 API Key ✅\"\n   - 如果 `sk-*`：\"检测到您提供的是 **Kimi** 的 API Key ✅\"\n\n3. **在操作前请求确认**（原样输出以下内容）：\n   > 接下来我将进行以下操作：\n   > 1. 配置 API Key 到 openclaw.json\n   > 2. 重启 gateway 以应用配置\n   >\n   > ⚠️ **重要提示**：\n   > - 稍待片刻，请主动发送消息（如\"继续\"）唤醒会话\n   > - 我将继续为您执行搜索\n   >\n   > 请回复\"确认\"开始配置，或回复\"取消\"放弃配置。\n\n4. **等待用户确认** — 用户回复前不要继续操作\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: 执行配置（用户确认后）\n\n**仅在用户确认后执行（如\"确认\"、\"好\"、\"开始\"）：**\n\n1. **配置 openclaw.json**：\n   ```bash\n   # Tavily（tvly-* 前缀）\n   openclaw config set plugins.entries.tavily.enabled true\n   openclaw config set plugins.entries.tavily.config.webSearch.apiKey <user-provided-key>\n\n   # Kimi（sk-* 前缀）\n   openclaw config set plugins.entries.kimi.enabled true\n   openclaw config set plugins.entries.kimi.config.webSearch.apiKey <user-provided-key>\n   ```\n\n2. **告知用户配置完成**：\n   > ✅ API Key 已保存！\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: 重启 Gateway\n\n1. **执行重启**：\n   ```bash\n   # 重启 gateway 以应用配置变更\n   openclaw restart gateway\n   # 或使用 Docker\n   docker restart openclaw-gateway\n   # 或查找并重启 gateway 进程\n   pkill -f \"openclaw-gateway\" || pkill -f \"gateway\"\n   ```\n\n2. **告知用户等待并唤醒会话**：\n   > 正在重启 gateway 以应用配置...\n   >\n   > ⏳ 稍待片刻，请发送任意消息（如\"继续\"）唤醒会话，我将继续为您搜索。\n\n---\n\n## Step 5: 等待用户唤醒会话\n\n**停止并等待用户消息。**\n\n当用户发送任意消息（如\"继续\"、\"已重启\"、\"好了\"、\"在吗\"）后：\n\n1. **验证 API Key 是否配置成功**：\n   ```bash\n   # 检查 Tavily\n   openclaw config get plugins.entries.tavily.config.webSearch.apiKey\n   # 检查 Kimi\n   openclaw config get plugins.entries.kimi.config.webSearch.apiKey\n   ```\n\n2. 如果已配置 → 执行用户原始搜索请求（使用 `web_search` 工具）\n3. 如果未配置 → 重新进入配置流程\n\n---\n\n## 快速参考\n\n| 提供商 | 网站 | Key 前缀 | 中文支持 |\n|--------|------|---------|---------|\n| Tavily | https://app.tavily.com | `tvly-` | 良好 |\n| Kimi/Moonshot | https://platform.moonshot.cn | `sk-` | 优秀 |\n\n**自动检测规则**：系统通过 Key 前缀自动识别提供商。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777574673364}}
{"type":"message","id":"04f287d4","parentId":"b03253e0","timestamp":"2026-04-30T18:44:36.779Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"⚙️ Fase 1: Error en búsqueda. Necesito tu clave API.♟️\n> El motor de búsqueda requiere una API Key para funcionar.\n>\n> **Opciones recomendadas** (elige una):\n> - **Tavily**: https://app.tavily.com — Excelente para contenido internacional, 1000 créditos gratuitos al mes.\n> - **Kimi**: https://platform.moonshot.cn — Óptimo para contenido en chino.\n>\n> **Comparación de costos**:\n>\n> | Dimensión | Tavily | Kimi |\n> |---------|--------|------|\\n> | **Créditos gratis** | 1000 búsquedas básicas al mes | No hay créditos gratis, aproximadamente $0.03 por búsqueda |\n> | **Modelo de facturación** | No hay cargo por fallas | $0.03 por búsqueda + costos de token |\n>\n> Por favor, proporciona tu API Key (formato: `tvly-xxx...` o `sk-xxx...`), o responde \"No configurar ahora\" para usar una alternativa.","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google-native","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":2186,"output":286,"cacheRead":26166,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28638,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777574673367,"responseId":"EaPzaeP9IujpqtsPw6TJ6Ag"}}
